From d27fdda5f249b6f2416593f1689f13b2c1c04358 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juuso Alasuutari <juuso.alasuutari@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:53:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] network: write the final RGB into the caller's buffer

Before this commit, Enqueue copied the final RGB from a pooled tensor
into the caller's buffer on every frame. This commit makes the post head
write into the caller's buffer directly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
